## 📊 Ringkasan Akhir

| Lapisan | Lokasi | Prinsip CIA |
|---|---|---|
| 1. Verifikasi Email saat Daftar | `auth_page.dart` | Confidentiality |
| 2. Blokir Login Belum Verifikasi | `auth_page.dart` + `main.dart` | Confidentiality |
| 3. Firebase ID Token | `capture_page.dart` | Confidentiality |
| 4. Enkripsi HTTPS | Localtunnel | Confidentiality |
| 5. Verifikasi Token di Server | `server_colab.py` | Confidentiality |
| 6. Rate Limiting | `server_colab.py` | Availability |
| 7. Sanitasi Input Teks | `server_colab.py` | Integrity |
| 8. Validasi MIME Type | `server_colab.py` | Integrity |
| 9. Magic Bytes Verification | `server_colab.py` | Integrity |
| 10. Validasi Ukuran File | `server_colab.py` | Availability |
| 11. Path Traversal Prevention | `server_colab.py` | Integrity |
| 12. Security HTTP Headers | `server_colab.py` | Integrity |
| 13. Error Masking | `server_colab.py` | Confidentiality |
| 14. Firebase Security Rules | Firebase Console | Confidentiality |

> **Kesimpulan:** Sistem ini menerapkan 14 lapisan keamanan menggunakan
> pendekatan Defense in Depth, mencakup seluruh aspek CIA Triad, dan
> memenuhi standar keamanan aplikasi mobile modern.
